### ScarborMusic — Upload API Tests
### Compatible with: VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP Client
### Prerequisite: Login first to get access_token cookie
###   POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Step 0: Login (to get access_token cookie for auth)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 0. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "testdev@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Get Presigned URL for Image Upload
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1a. Presigned URL — JPEG image (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/presigned-url
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "filename": "photo.jpg",
  "contentType": "image/jpeg",
  "fileSize": 102400,
  "fileType": "image"
}

### Expected Response (200):
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "uploadUrl": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/scarbormusic/images/.../...jpg?...",
#     "objectKey": "images/{userId}/{date}/{uuid}.jpg",
#     "publicUrl": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/scarbormusic/images/..."
#   }
# }

### 1b. Presigned URL — PNG image (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/presigned-url
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "filename": "cover.png",
  "contentType": "image/png",
  "fileSize": 204800,
  "fileType": "image"
}

### 1c. Presigned URL — WebP image (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/presigned-url
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "filename": "thumbnail.webp",
  "contentType": "image/webp",
  "fileSize": 51200,
  "fileType": "image"
}

### 1d. Presigned URL — MP3 audio (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/presigned-url
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "filename": "song.mp3",
  "contentType": "audio/mpeg",
  "fileSize": 5242880,
  "fileType": "audio"
}

### 1e. Presigned URL — WAV audio (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/presigned-url
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "filename": "track.wav",
  "contentType": "audio/wav",
  "fileSize": 10485760,
  "fileType": "audio"
}

### 1f. Presigned URL — FLAC audio (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/presigned-url
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "filename": "master.flac",
  "contentType": "audio/flac",
  "fileSize": 20971520,
  "fileType": "audio"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. Rejection Cases
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2a. Reject EXE file (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/presigned-url
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "filename": "malware.exe",
  "contentType": "application/x-msdownload",
  "fileSize": 1024,
  "fileType": "image"
}

### 2b. Reject PHP file (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/presigned-url
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "filename": "shell.php",
  "contentType": "application/x-php",
  "fileSize": 512,
  "fileType": "image"
}

### 2c. Reject JS file (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/presigned-url
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "filename": "exploit.js",
  "contentType": "application/javascript",
  "fileSize": 256,
  "fileType": "audio"
}

### 2d. Image too large (> 5MB, should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/presigned-url
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "filename": "huge.jpg",
  "contentType": "image/jpeg",
  "fileSize": 6291456,
  "fileType": "image"
}

### 2e. Audio too large (> 50MB, should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/presigned-url
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "filename": "huge_audio.mp3",
  "contentType": "audio/mpeg",
  "fileSize": 52428800,
  "fileType": "audio"
}

### 2f. Unauthenticated request (should return 401)
# Clear cookie first
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/presigned-url
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: access_token=invalid.token.here

{
  "filename": "test.jpg",
  "contentType": "image/jpeg",
  "fileSize": 1024,
  "fileType": "image"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. Confirm Upload (run after actual upload via presigned URL)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3a. Confirm upload (replace objectKey with actual key from step 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/complete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "objectKey": "REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_OBJECT_KEY",
  "fileName": "photo.jpg",
  "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
  "fileType": "image"
}

### Expected Response (200):
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "File upload confirmed successfully",
#   "data": {
#     "id": "uuid",
#     "url": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/scarbormusic/...",
#     "objectKey": "images/...",
#     "size": "102400",
#     "etag": "abc123",
#     "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
#     "fileType": "image"
#   }
# }

### 3b. Confirm non-existent file (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/complete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "objectKey": "images/fake-user/2026-01-01/nonexistent.jpg",
  "fileName": "ghost.jpg",
  "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
  "fileType": "image"
}
